  "title": "Monitor and optimize GenAI workloads on Azure",
  "description": "Monitoring GenAI applications requires more than traditional telemetry—latency, cost, and model quality all matter.\nLearn how to monitor and optimize large language model workloads on Azure using Azure OpenAI, App Services, and Datadog. Explore real-world patterns for tracking latency, evaluating model quality, and measuring usage at scale.\nWalk away with practical strategies to keep GenAI applications reliable, cost-efficient, and performant in production.\n\nSeating for this session is first-come, first-served. Add it to your schedule to plan your day and arrive early to secure a spot.",
